00:27:24.920 --> 00:27:47.079
here was to create personas that were just around digital behavior engagements. So it wasn't personas that included demographics, it wasn't demographics and psychographics and fan behavior, it was just the fan behavior. Because layering in the demographic data and the

00:27:47.079 --> 00:28:16.359
