00:28:16.359 --> 00:28:46.280
psychographics after to see where those people fell in those digital behavioral engagement buckets meant that we could take these personas and share them with every different vertical of the organization. And if they wanted demographic information, then we could add that in. If they wanted psychographic information, we could layer that on top of these personas, rather than having those be the defining features.

